        <p>GD¹ sections from the Project Gutenberg transcriptions (#51052, #67966, #68527, #69005) and the NRI "1e druk" table of contents. GD² sections from the NRI "2e druk" table of contents (modernized spelling); verify against the printed second edition.</p>
